<title>JAPAN: Sega to announce cancelling of Bandai merger - Jiji.</title>
<headline>Sega to announce cancelling of Bandai merger - Jiji.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sega Enterprises Ltd will hold a news conference at 9 p.m. (1200 GMT) to announce the cancellation of its planned merger with Bandai Co Ltd, Jiji news service said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
